      "solution": "**Given**\n\n70% of (x - y) = 30% of (x + y)\n\n**Solution**\n\n7(x - y) = 3(x + y)\n\n7x - 7y = 3x + 3y\n\n4x = 10y\n\nx = 2.5y\n\ny = x/2.5 = 0.4x\n\n**Therefore, y is 40% of x**",
