      "question": "If 22% of x = 30% of y, then y : x is equal to:",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "1",
          "text": "15 : 11"
        },
        {
          "label": "2",
          "text": "11 : 15"
        },
        {
          "label": "3",
          "text": "17 : 16"
        },
        {
          "label": "4",
          "text": "15 : 14"
        }
      ],
      "correct": "2",
      "solution": "**Given:**\n\n22% of x = 30% of y\n\n**Formula:**\n\nx% of y = y × (x/100)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n22% of x = 30% of y\n\n⇒ x × (22/100) = y × (30/100)\n\n⇒ x/y = 30/22\n\n⇒ y/x = 22/30\n\n∴ y : x = 11 : 15",
      "tags": [
        "Simplification",
        "Ratio and Proportion"
      ]
