      "solution": "Let us examine each option,\n\n**OPTION 1)**\n\n34 + 4 × 15 - 51 = 27 ÷ 9 + 40\n\n34 + 60 - 51 = 3 + 40\n\n94 - 51 = 43\n\n43 = 43 \n\nTherefore, **LHS = RHS**\n\n**OPTION 2)**\n\n34 - 4 + 15 = 51 × 27 - 9 + 40\n\n34 - 11 = 1377 - 9 + 40\n\n33 is not equal to 1328\n\n**OPTION 3)**\n\n34 + 4 - 15 = 51 × 27 ÷ 9 - 40\n\n38 - 15 = 51 × 3 - 40\n\n23 = 153 - 40\n\n23 is not equal to 113\n\n**OPTION 4)**\n\n34 ÷ 4 - 15 = 51 × 27 ÷ 9 - 40\n\n8.5 - 15 = 51 × 3 - 40\n\n-6.5 is not equal to 113\n\nHence, The correct answer is \" +, ×, -, =, ÷, +\"",
