      "correct": "1",
      "solution": "**Concept used:-**\n\nProperties of exponents and powers = a2 - b2 = (a + b)(a - b)\n\nCalculation**:- **\n\nUsing the exponent property (a^n)/(a^m)=aⁿ⁻m in the given expression,\n\n⇒ 2²(x)⁽a⁻b⁾⁽a⁺b⁾×3²(x)⁽b⁻c⁾⁽b⁺c⁾×6⁻²(x)⁽c⁻a⁾⁽c⁺a⁾\n\nBy using the formula, **a² - b² = (a + b)(a - b)**\n\n⇒ 2²(x)⁽a²⁻b²⁾×3²(x)⁽b²⁻c²⁾×6⁻²(x)⁽c²⁻a²⁾ \n\n⇒ 2²(x)⁽a²⁻b²⁾×3²(x)⁽b²⁻c²⁾times(3×2)⁻²(x)⁽c²⁻a²⁾\n\nBy using the exponent property, **(a × b)m = am × bm**\n\n⇒ 2²(x)⁽a²⁻b²⁾×3²(x)⁽b²⁻c²⁾times(3)⁻²times(2)⁻²(x)⁽c²⁻a²⁾\n\nBy using the property **am ****× aⁿ = a⁽m ⁺ ⁿ⁾** \n\n⇒ 2⁽²⁺⁽⁻²⁾⁾times 3⁽²⁺⁽⁻²⁾times x⁽a^{²-b²)+(b²-c²)+(c²-a²)}\n\nBy the property of exponents, i.e** a⁰ = 1**\n\n⇒ 2⁰ × 3⁰ × x⁰ \n\n⇒ 1 × 1 × 1 = 1\n\n**The value of the expression is 1.**",
